      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تجالّ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَاظَمَ</span> (S, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرَفَّعَ</span>. (S.)
You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ يَتَجَالُّ عَنْ ذٰلكَ</span> (S, K *) <i>Such a
one exalts himself above that; holds himself above
it; disdains it;</i> or <i>is disdainful of it;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَتَرَفَّعُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْهُ</span>, (S,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَتَعَاظَمُ</span>; (K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يتجالّ عَلَيْهِ</span>.
(TA.) ― 
